# Legacy compatibility marker only. No Compose service consumes runtime.env.
# Use the scoped *.env.example files in this directory and install populated
# copies under /srv/clixor/secrets with owner root:root and mode 0600. Production
# instead consumes one OCI Vault generation through /run/clixor/secrets/active.
#
# bootstrap.sh safely splits an existing runtime.env once, preserves exact
# values without shell evaluation, and leaves unknown entries here for manual
# review. Do not merge the scoped files back together.
